{"id":"marca","name":"Marca","tagline":"Find saved websites &amp; app deeplinks quickly using powerful tagging and full-text search","blurb":"Marca's a URL manager.","description":"Marca's a URL manager. It treats everything as tags: tags themselves, hierarchy (akin to folders), whether a bookmark is trashed, uncategorized, etc. All this, + inclusive/exclusive filtering is available through the sidebar.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Full-Text Search\n\n• Filter using tags inclusively/exclusively\n\n• Sort by created, modified, title, URL, Relevance\n\n• Keyboard controls\n\n• Import/export to JSON/HTML\n\n• Coming soon: cloud-free sync, reader mode and more.","developer":"Simonas Ju","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/icons/128x128/io.github.simoonas.marca.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-1_752x623@1.png","w":946,"h":784},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-2_752x660@1.png","w":878,"h":771},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-3_752x660@1.png","w":878,"h":771},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/simoonas.marca/38b0b1c81d4790ab3fd03114ab3e6d0e/screenshots/image-4_752x623@1.png","w":946,"h":784}],"categories":["Internet & Browsing","Utilities"],"tags":["utility","